VisiCutR is a Rust reimplementation in a fork of VisiCut by Thomas Oster and
contributors (https://github.com/t-oster/VisiCut), which is licensed under
the same terms. The Java source tree of VisiCut and its third-party notices
are kept in this repository's history and in the tag java-reference.

The Rust crates VisiCutR builds on carry their own licenses; see Cargo.toml
and Cargo.lock for the list.
